	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "T37-6 toroid, 27 turns of 0.4mm enamelled wire, mounted ON EDGE (vertical). One universal footprint for all 7 receiver toroids: pins 1=cold end, 2=tap (13/27, leave empty for plain coils), 3=hot end, 4/5=coupling link (3 turns, leave empty except the two IF-filter tanks). Wound body ~10.5mm dia x 4mm thick; secure with nylon M3 screw through the core or a dab of RTV silicone - never hot glue.")
